--- Namespace Module Value Tester ---
--- Reading members ---
PASS: constant member
PASS: function member
PASS: text form
--- Truthiness ---
PASS: BOOL of a module
PASS: module OR 0
--- INSTANCEOF ---
PASS: module is an Object
PASS: module is not a Number
PASS: module is not a String
PASS: module is not a Function
PASS: module is not a List
PASS: module is not a Dict
PASS: module is not an Enum
--- Operations that raise ---
PASS: LEN of a module -> LEN is not supported for type 'Module'
PASS: increment a module -> Operand must be a number
